                "title": "83 Inch Standard Full Mortise Continuous Geared Hinge, Bommer FM83HD",
                "description": "Bommer FM83HD - These 83 inch long full mortise continuous gear hinges for doors up to 6 feet, 10 inches. Full Mortise Continuous Gear Hinges are normally used in new construction and are applied as to conceal both hinge leaves. Also used in renovations and the leaves will cover existing standard door hinge preps. Full Mortise Hinge - The frame leaf is fastened to the door frame jamb. Door leaf is fastened to the door edge. \r\n",
